//
// Qwen3.5-0.8B Q4NX verify gate: top-k token-level inclusion check, NPU vs HF
// BF16, 2 prompts x 32 greedy tokens, k=5 (`make verify-full` for every
// prompt). Exercises the production path through the verify subsystem
// (verify/verify_runner.py): the prompt on the shared fused_prefill device,
// then one fused_decode_gdn dispatch per token. NPU weights come from
// FastFlowLM's model.q4nx (FastFlowLM/Qwen3.5-0.8B-NPU2, branch
// flm_q4k_high_precision, pinned revision and sha256), the reference from the
// checkpoint it was quantized from, Qwen/Qwen3.5-0.8B at its pinned revision.
// See verify_adapter.py.
//
// The decode is built at capacity 1024 only: the gate's prompts and their 32
// generated tokens fit it.
//
// REQUIRES: ryzen_ai_npu2, peano, peano_ge22, llvm_link_pre23, hf_token, hfweights_fastflowlm_qwen3_5_0_8b_npu2, hfweights_qwen_qwen3_5_0_8b
//
// RUN: mkdir -p test_npu2_verify
// RUN: cd test_npu2_verify
// RUN: make -f %S/Makefile clean
// RUN: make -f %S/Makefile compile CAPACITIES=1024 PEANO_INSTALL_DIR=%PEANO_INSTALL_DIR
// RUN: %run_on_npu2% make -f %S/Makefile verify C=1024 PEANO_INSTALL_DIR=%PEANO_INSTALL_DIR | FileCheck %s
// CHECK: [verify] PASS
